/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T16:23:14-07:00","id":1111448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1111410-how-could-a-toy-factory-work-as-infrastructure?p=1111430#post1111430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What type of Infrastructure would it be? Concealment? Defense? Logistical? Elimination? C&amp;C?</div> </div> </div> </div>Either Concealment, Logistics or C@C.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T16:35:09-07:00","id":1111454,"title":"","content":"Concealment: There's something down there, in the basement of the factory. That it's a toy factory is just coincidence, but maybe one could investigate the Infrastructure by noticing that some of the stuff that goes into the factory have nothing to do with making toys.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, the toys are being used to hide something. Cameras in teddy bears' eyes, anyone?<br /> <br /> Logistics: The materials the factory receives are either unrelated to toy-making, or too much compared to what the factory makes. Same course of investigation as above.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, the toys are being used to gather resources. Maybe they're remote-controlled puppets, or have an Imperator (Rank 1 pseudo-angels) riding them. Once they gather what they need from households, they break automatically and are sent in recall to the factory.<br /> <br /> C&amp;C: Some of the toys that the factory makes are angels.<br /> <br /> <br /> Someone will have better ideas - I'm still getting the hang of Demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T21:27:01-07:00","id":1111548,"title":"","content":"I'm just spit balling but I hope you like it<br /> <br /> <b>Name:</b> The Toy Factory<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Information:</b> Toy's are meant give joy and some even let children feel protected. The toy factory goes about bringing joy to everyone around the world. Founded by Dr. Gary V. Neuman a Irish immigrant who came to -------- with nothing but a dream and $4 dollars in his pocket. Using his god given talent for building toys he soon came into great wealth and use it to build The Toy Factory. The largest toy company in the world. The newest toy from the toy factory is &quot;The Jester&quot; $4.49. This toy will keep your children entertained for years to come. Each jester has a computer chip that connects to your WiFi and downloads jokes, facts and so many other wonderful things. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Type: </b>Concealment</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Function:</b> The Checkered board pattern on the jester toys puts anyone who looks at the toy into a highly suggestible state. Once in this state the jokes told by &quot;The Jester&quot; implant instructions into the subconscious of the listener. The fabric the doll is covered is is the fine hairs of others who died during child birth. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Security:</b> Cultists, Cryptid &quot;The Jester&quot; </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Linchpin:</b> A Jar Filled with the Souls and Creativity of 100 children lost in the towns woods. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b>Occult Matrix:</b> (You can come up wit that) </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T21:39:00-07:00","id":1111551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1111410-how-could-a-toy-factory-work-as-infrastructure#post1111410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am thinking about getting Demon and i already came up with a infrastructure idea. It is basically a toy factory owned by a GM influenced company called Happy Jester Toys. My question is how could a Toy Factory work as infrastructure?</div> </div> </div> </div>But of course. Haven't you ever heard of Doctor Wondertainment from the SCP Foundation universe? You should take a look at some of the <a href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/dr-wondertainment\" target=\"_blank\"><b>SCPs tagged &quot;Doctor Wondertainment&quot;</b></a> for inspiration, such as SCP-111, SCP-1696, SCP-846, SCP-1997 and SCP-1103. They're all wondrous and often subtly creepy, especially the Little Misters, which could be Stigmatics that have Glitches, Supernatural Merits, Gadgets and other abilities meant to turn them into living collectable toys. And apparently whoever collects them all will become Mr Collector, which I bet could work as inspiration for an Occult Matrix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 07-05-2017, 12:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T01:37:57-07:00","id":1111582,"title":"","content":"The Cryptid I mentioned in my previous post<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;f