 taking random victims and making others paranoid.</span><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>The idea is pretty good, but it's too strong, don't you think? Especially considering that there would be many Jesters, and that the Demon book says Cryptids with Rank 6+ can't exist in the mortal realm for long and usually flee to the Hedge/Shadow/Underworld/Astral etc. And some Skills and Advantages are missing numbers. Also, why does it have Integrity?<br /> <br /> Here's how I would do it:<br /> <br /> <b>Name: </b>The Jester<br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Humor<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Sadistic/Nosy<br /> <b>Mental Attributes: </b>Intelligence 3, Wits 4, Resolve 3<br /> <b>Physical Attributes: </b>Strength 3, Dexterity 4, Stamina 3<br /> <b>Social Attributes: </b>Presence 3, Manipulation 4, Composure 3<br /> <b>Mental Skills:</b> Investigation (Spying) 3, Crafts (Traps) 2, Occult 2<br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Athletics (Chase) 3, Brawl 2, Larceny (Sleight Of Hand) 4, Stealth (Plain Sight, Ambush) 3, Survival 2, Weaponry (Blades) 3<br /> <b>Social Skills:</b> Empathy 2, Expression (Jokes) 2, Persuasion 3, Subterfuge (Blaming Others, Imitating Voices) 3<br /> <b>Merits: </b>Trained Observer 3, Vice-Ridden, Demolisher 2, Double Jointed, Greyhound, Quick Draw (Blades), Sleight Of Hand, Fast Talking 5, Table Turner, Aura Reading, Clairvoyance, Telekinesis 5, Telepathy 5<br /> <b>Health: </b>5<br /> <b>Willpower: </b>6<br /> <b>Size: </b>2<br /> <b>Speed: </b>10 (Species Factor 3)<br /> <b>Defense: </b>7<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>7<br /> <b>Rank: </b>3<br /> <b>Aether</b>: 15<br /> <b>Adaptations: </b>Aether Eater, Aether Hive, Numen (Hallucination, Implant Mission), Occluded<br /> <b>Weapons/Attacks:</b><br /> Blades [+1L, Melee, 7 Dice]<br /> Claws [+0L, Melee, 5 Dice]<br /> Traps [Variable Damage Bonus, 7 Dice]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence"